{
  "sourceLanguage": "es",
  "strings": {
    "\nDescarga MonAvi y gana cashback con tus facturas: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nDownload MonAvi and earn cashback on your receipts: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\nÚnete a MonAvi con mi código %@ y gana cashback tú también: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nJoin MonAvi with my code %@ and earn cashback too: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " (%@%%/mes de interes)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " (%@%%/month interest)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " No tomes deuda nueva y usa la tarjeta solo si la pagas completa.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Don’t take on new debt, and only use the card if you pay it off in full."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Para no sobreendeudarte necesitas aumentar tus ingresos en unos %@ al mes o bajar tus deudas, y no usar más la tarjeta por ahora.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " To avoid overextending yourself, you need to raise your income by about %@ a month or lower your debts, and stop using the card for now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Separa %@ al mes (20%% de lo que te queda libre).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Set aside %@ a month (20%% of what you have left over)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Solo afecta el orden entre tus deudas en el plan de \"qué pagar primero\" al registrar un ingreso.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " It only affects the order of your debts in the \"what to pay first\" plan when you log income."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " de %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " para «%@»": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " for “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " y tu cuenta de ahorros": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " and your savings account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · Parece que ya lo anotaste: revísalo antes de guardarlo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Looks like you already logged it: check it before saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · Toca para registrar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Tap to log."
