        }
      }
    },
    "Educación": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Education"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Efectivo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ej. Yappy, Banco General. Solo para mostrarlo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E.g. Yappy, Banco General. For display only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ej. crear un fondo de emergencia, liquidar una deuda, organizar el presupuesto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E.g. build an emergency fund, pay off a debt, organize your budget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ej. educacion de la familia, invertir en bienes raices, independencia financiera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E.g. family education, investing in real estate, financial independence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Método MonAvi es educación financiera general. No es asesoría de inversión ni recomienda productos o entidades.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The MonAvi Method is general financial education. It is not investment advice and does not recommend products or institutions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El PDF pesa más de 10 MB. Prueba con una foto o un PDF más liviano.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The PDF is larger than 10 MB. Try a photo or a smaller PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El asistente de IA no está disponible en este momento. Intenta de nuevo más tarde.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The AI assistant isn’t available right now. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El cashback llega cuando tu amigo registra su primera factura y se confirma. Se premian hasta 10 invitaciones cada 30 días.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cashback arrives when your friend logs their first receipt and it's confirmed. Up to 10 invitations are rewarded every 30 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código QR está incompleto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The QR code is incomplete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código de la factura (CUFE) no tiene el formato esperado.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The receipt code (CUFE) isn’t in the expected format."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código de tu app de autenticación no es correcto. Inténtalo de nuevo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The code from your authenticator app isn't correct. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código es incorrecto o ya venció. Revísalo o pide uno nuevo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The code is incorrect or has expired. Check it or request a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código no es correcto. Revísalo o pide uno nuevo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The code isn’t correct. Check it or request a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El dinero está bloqueado hasta una fecha": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The money is locked until a date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El día que cobres, aparta primero tu ahorro y vive con el resto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On payday, set aside your savings first and live on the rest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El gasto se registra de una vez. Verificamos tu factura al guardarla: si ya está publicada, tu cashback (1%%) se suma enseguida; si no, la volvemos a revisar en 24 horas y queda pendiente hasta confirmarla.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The expense is logged right away. We verify your receipt when you save it: if it's already published, your cashback (1%%) is added immediately; if not, we check again in 24 hours and it stays pending until confirmed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El monto tiene que ser mayor que cero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The amount has to be greater than zero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El pago baja de esa cuenta y reduce lo que debes. No cuenta como gasto nuevo: lo que compraste con la tarjeta ya se contó.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The payment comes out of that account and reduces what you owe. It doesn't count as a new expense: what you bought with the card was already counted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El reconocimiento de voz no está disponible ahora mismo. Revisa tu conexión a internet e intenta de nuevo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice recognition isn’t available right now. Check your internet connection and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El texto de la notificación, el SMS o el correo del banco.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The text of the bank's notification, SMS, or email."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El texto del aviso se lee en tu teléfono y no se guarda: solo el movimiento que confirmes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The alert text is read on your phone and isn't saved: only the transaction you confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elegir PDF": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose PDF"
