    "Empezar a invertir con lo que no vas a necesitar pronto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start investing with money you won’t need soon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empieza a anotar tus movimientos para ver cómo vas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start logging your transactions to see how you're doing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empieza aprendiendo las opciones básicas y compara riesgo, plazo, comisiones y que la entidad esté regulada.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start by learning the basic options and compare risk, term, fees, and whether the institution is regulated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empieza gratis": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En **Ajustes > Accesibilidad > Tocar > Tocar atrás**, elige **Triple toque** (o Doble toque) y selecciona **MonAvi gasto**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Settings > Accessibility > Touch > Back Tap**, choose **Triple Tap** (or Double Tap) and select **MonAvi Expense**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En **Atajos**, toca **+**, busca **MonAvi** y elige **Anotar gasto rápido**. Guárdalo como **MonAvi gasto**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Shortcuts**, tap **+**, search for **MonAvi** and choose **Log quick expense**. Save it as **MonAvi Expense**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En **Aviso**, elige la variable **Entrada del atajo**. Si quieres, escribe el nombre del banco en **App o banco**. Toca **Listo**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Notice**, choose the **Shortcut Input** variable. If you want, type your bank's name in **App or bank**. Tap **Done**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En **Monto**, elige la variable **Cantidad** (o Monto) de la transacción; en **Comercio**, elige **Comercio**. Si quieres, elige también la cuenta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In **Amount**, choose the transaction's **Amount** variable; in **Merchant**, choose **Merchant**. If you want, also choose the account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En 3 días vence %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is due in 3 days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En compras desde %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On purchases of %@ or more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
