      }
    },
    "Llevas %@ de %@ días anotados este mes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've logged %@ of %@ days this month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Llevas %@ en gastos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've spent %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Llevas %@ en gastos y te entran %@: son %@ de más. Ese dinero sale de tus ahorros o de deuda. Frena los gastos que no sean necesarios hasta fin de mes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %@ in expenses and %@ coming in: that’s %@ too much. That money comes out of your savings or debt. Hold off on unnecessary expenses until the end of the month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo anotamos con este monto solo esta vez. El de siempre sigue igual.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We'll log it with this amount just this once. Your usual amount stays the same."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo anotamos este mes y lo guardamos como gasto fijo para recordártelo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We'll log it this month and save it as a recurring expense to remind you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo ideal es usar menos del 30%% del cupo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ideally, use less than 30%% of your credit limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo ideal es usar menos del 30%: cuida tu historial de crédito.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ideally, use less than 30%: protect your credit history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo pagaste %@ (%@). Si lo guardamos como fijo, te lo recordamos cada mes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You paid it %@ (%@). If we save it as recurring, we'll remind you every month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo pagaste %@ (%@). ¿Lo registramos este mes?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You paid it %@ (%@). Should we log it this month?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo pagué con %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I paid with %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que ahorras en un mes tiene que caber en lo que registraste ese mes (ingresos menos gastos). Anota tus ingresos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you save in a month has to fit within what you logged that month (income minus expenses). Log your income."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que tienes guardado no alcanza para un mes de pagos fijos: todavía no tienes colchón para imprevistos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you have saved isn’t enough for one month of recurring payments: you don’t have an emergency fund yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que vemos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What we see"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo verás como una cuenta más en Hoy y en Ajustes > Cuentas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll see it as another account in Today and in Settings > Accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los 7 pasos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The 7 steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los avisos de tu banco y tus pagos con Apple Pay quedan listos para confirmar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your bank alerts and Apple Pay payments are ready to confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los cupones los paga MonAvi y se entregan solos cuando cumples. Te avisamos y aparecen en Mis cupones y canjes con su código para caja.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MonAvi pays for the coupons and they're delivered automatically when you meet the goal. We'll let you know, and they appear in My coupons and redemptions with their checkout code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los códigos de seguridad, las compras rechazadas y las promociones se ignoran siempre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Security codes, declined purchases, and promotions are always ignored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los códigos vencen a los 7 días. Si no lo usas a tiempo, te devolvemos tu cashback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codes expire after 7 days. If you don't use it in time, we'll give your cashback back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los datos del código QR no coinciden entre sí — podría estar alterado.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The QR code data doesn’t match — it may have been altered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los días anotados se cuentan el día que anotas, no la fecha que le pones al movimiento.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logged days count on the day you log, not the date you give the transaction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los pagos mínimos de tus deudas (%@ al mes) se llevan el %@ de tus ingresos%@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The minimum payments on your debts (%@ a month) take up %@ of your income%@."
          }
        }
