    "No encontramos el código QR de una factura en ese archivo. Abre la factura y escanea su QR con la cámara.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We couldn’t find a receipt QR code in that file. Open the receipt and scan its QR code with the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No encontramos la factura": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We couldn't find the receipt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No encontramos tu verificación en 2 pasos. Inténtalo de nuevo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We couldn't find your two-step verification. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No encontramos un correo en tu cuenta. Cierra sesión y vuelve a entrar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We couldn't find an email on your account. Sign out and sign back in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No encontramos un movimiento en ese texto. El aviso tiene que traer el monto con su moneda (B/., $ o USD) y decir si fue una compra, un pago o un dinero recibido.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We couldn't find a transaction in that text. The notice has to include the amount with its currency (B/., $ or USD) and say whether it was a purchase, a payment or money received."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No entendimos el monto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We didn’t understand the amount"
          }
        }
      }
    },
