    "Paga el mínimo de todas y manda todo lo extra a %@. Cuando la termines, sigue con la siguiente.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay the minimum on all of them and send everything extra to %@. When it's paid off, move on to the next one."
