    "Se borra de tus movimientos y su monto vuelve al saldo de la cuenta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's removed from your transactions and its amount goes back to the account balance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se borra de tus movimientos, su monto vuelve al saldo de la cuenta y se quita el cashback de esa factura.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's removed from your transactions, its amount goes back to the account balance, and the cashback from that receipt is taken away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se borran para siempre tus cuentas, movimientos, presupuestos, deudas, metas de ahorro, facturas, cashback y todo lo demás que hayas registrado en MonAvi. No hay forma de recuperarlo después.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently deletes your accounts, transactions, budgets, debts, savings goals, receipts, cashback, and everything else you've logged in MonAvi. There's no way to recover it afterward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se calcula con tus pagos fijos, deudas y cuentas en MonAvi. Si algo cambió, actualízalo y vuelve aquí.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's calculated from your recurring payments, debts and accounts in MonAvi. If something changed, update it and come back here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se comparte como imagen con el enlace de descarga.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's shared as an image with the download link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se comparte como imagen con tu código de invitación: si tus amigos se unen con él, los dos ganan cashback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's shared as an image with your referral code: if your friends sign up with it, you both earn cashback."
