    "Se libera cuando tus ingresos registrados respalden tus compras.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's released when your logged income backs up your purchases."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se premia la constancia, no el monto: apartar $5 cada semana vale lo mismo que apartar $500.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consistency is rewarded, not the amount: setting aside $5 every week counts the same as setting aside $500."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se registra un gasto por cada categoría, con la misma cuenta y fecha.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One expense is logged for each category, with the same account and date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se registrará también como movimiento en la cuenta vinculada.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It will also be logged as a transaction in the linked account."
